      "message": "build(xtask): one cross-platform gate and decision collector\n\n`cargo xtask gate quick|batch|release|test <name>` and `cargo xtask\ndecisions --version X.Y.Z` replace the gate.ps1/gate.sh and\ncollect-decisions.ps1/.sh twins with one Rust implementation in a new\nworkspace member `xtask/` (publish = false, alias in .cargo/config.toml).\nIt reproduces gate.ps1 (tiers, SLOW_BINARIES, crate lists, -j 6 / 6 test\nthreads, ui CWD, quick's diff-to-test-fn selection, logs, summary, exit\ncode); --dry-run output matches gate.ps1 -DryRun line for line for batch,\nrelease, a sample quick diff and single tests. Two gate.ps1 -Test bugs\nare fixed (a src/ tests module was planned as a nonexistent suite;\nseveral lib files gave duplicate --lib steps). The old scripts are thin\nwrappers that forward their flags. AGENTS.md, the gate-running agents and\nskills name the one command; xtask/ and .cargo/config.toml join the fork\nprocess-sync files; PROCESS_VERSION 7. release.ps1 stays as is (#749).\n\nRefs #748\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
